   "text": "States:\nempty — server not found: \"No tool server at <address>\" with \"Change server…\" and \"Retry\"\nloading — progress bar as above, \"Sign in\" disabled\nerror — \"Sign-in failed. Check user name and password.\" (no hint which one was wrong); \"No role is assigned to this account. Contact the data manager.\"; build failed: engine message (first\nline), \"Retry\"\nsuccess — opens the role's landing screen; the header shows name, role and scope",
   "originalText": "States:\nempty — server not found: \"No tool server at <address>\" with \"Change server…\" and \"Retry\"\nloading — progress bar as above, \"Sign in\" disabled\nerror — \"Sign-in failed. Check user name and password.\" (no hint which one was wrong); \"No role is assigned to this account. Contact the data manager.\"; build failed: engine message (first\nline), \"Retry\"\nsuccess — opens the role's landing screen; the header shows name, role and scope",
